    },
    {
     "type": "note",
     "title": "Three ways to guess the article",
     "md": "1. **Natural sex**: a man is *der*, a woman is *die* ({de:der Pilot}, {de:die Pilotin}).\n2. **Meaning**: some groups always share an article (days, months, seasons, car brands …).\n3. **Ending** (*die Nachsilbe*) — the most useful for beginners.\n\nAnd the golden rule from the video: **always learn a noun together with its article.**"
    },
